<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef firm on light to moderate demand and offerings.  Select chuck and round cuts steady to firm, while rib and loin cuts firm.  Choice rib, chuck, round and loin cuts firm. Beef trimmings generally steady on light demand. -USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>231 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 21 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>21 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     106.17	105.62	 99.13	 97.47</p>
<p>Changes	   1.07	  0.81	  0.61	  0.65</p>
<p>Rib	  166.21	165.96	147.31	144.86</p>
<p>Chuck	 74.45	 72.88	 78.38	 73.08</p>
<p>Round	 93.42	 93.42	 89.82	 89.82</p>
<p>Loin	 165.84	165.53	141.04	141.85</p>
